{"ID":"20250328155528-9s1lnjl","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"2795","id":"20250328155528-9s1lnjl","title":"CPP——C++笔记","type":"doc","updated":"20250328161030"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328155528-g4j4z9u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250328155528-g4j4z9u","updated":"20250328161030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C++"}]},{"ID":"20250328155746-phtzl09","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250328155746-phtzl09","updated":"20250328155853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250328155748-8f7jdno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328155748-8f7jdno","updated":"20250328155759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C++ 是一种高级语言，它是由 Bjarne Stroustrup 于 1979 年在贝尔实验室开始设计开发的。\nC++ 进一步扩充和完善了 C 语言，是一种面向对象的程序设计语言。\nC++ 可运行于多种平台上，如 Windows、MAC 操作系统以及 UNIX 的各种版本。"}]},{"ID":"20250328155849-iqlfxg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328155849-iqlfxg0","updated":"20250328155853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C++ 是一种静态类型的、编译式的、通用的、大小写敏感的、不规则的编程语言，支持过程化编程、面向对象编程和泛型编程。\nC++ 被认为是一种"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中级"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"语言，它综合了高级语言和低级语言的特点。\nC++ 是由 Bjarne Stroustrup 于 1979 年在新泽西州美利山贝尔实验室开始设计开发的。C++ 进一步扩充和完善了 C 语言，最初命名为带类的C，后来在 1983 年更名为 C++。C++ 是 C 的一个超集，事实上，任何合法的 C 程序都是合法的 C++ 程序。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250328155800-c3b1ijl","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250328155800-c3b1ijl","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250328155958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250328155903-7j2gck0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250328155903-7j2gck0","updated":"20250328155958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意！"}]},{"ID":"20250328155914-cnov4ys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328155914-cnov4ys","updated":"20250328155958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UE 开发中使用的 C++ 本质上是 C++ 的一个超集，它支持和使用 C++ 的全部特性，还在它的标准上自己构建了一套语法。\n因此在真正学习 UE 之前，我们应该系统的学习 C++ 相关的知识，这更有助于我们之后系统的学习 UE（虚幻引I擎）！"}]}]},{"ID":"20250328160011-bmsg9wu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328160011-bmsg9wu","updated":"20250328160027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"笔记代号CPP——即 C Plus Plus 的缩写"}]},{"ID":"20250328160011-nfe3cyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328160011-nfe3cyt","updated":"20250328160011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本笔记包括以下系列"}]},{"ID":"20250328160011-1cu1vlw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250328160011-1cu1vlw","updated":"20250328161030"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328160011-80sthe4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250328160011-80sthe4","updated":"20250328161030"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328160011-v2mqojs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328160011-v2mqojs","updated":"20250328161030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250328161029-x1v2gpp","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"C++入门"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" - C++基本概念与基本逻辑"}]}]},{"ID":"20250328160011-3p5vpq6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250328160011-3p5vpq6","updated":"20250328160151"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328160011-ccrcgyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328160011-ccrcgyq","updated":"20250328160151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C++基础"}]}]},{"ID":"20250328160011-8x6ga6m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250328160011-8x6ga6m","updated":"20250328160148"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328160011-wa87sv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328160011-wa87sv7","updated":"20250328160148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C++核心"}]}]},{"ID":"20250328160011-roog2aj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250328160011-roog2aj","updated":"20250328160146"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328160011-d85dz61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328160011-d85dz61","updated":"20250328160146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C++进阶"}]}]}]}]}